# Requirements

## Software Requirements
- Microsoft Excel 2019 or later (Microsoft 365 recommended)
- Google Sheets (optional)
- A web browser to access the GitHub repository

## Dataset Requirements
- Sample Superstore Dataset in CSV or Excel format

## Skills Required
- Basic knowledge of Microsoft Excel
- Understanding of spreadsheet rows and columns
- Basic knowledge of formulas and functions

## Excel Functions
- SUM and AVERAGE
- SUMIF and SUMIFS
- COUNTIF
- XLOOKUP
- INDEX/MATCH
- IF and nested IF
- IFERROR
- LEFT, RIGHT, and CONCAT

## Files Required
- Excel formula practice workbook (.xlsx)
- README.md
- Sample Superstore dataset (if redistribution is permitted)
